e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ByLu487UCbAQ7kNvwHbPQBX&_nc_oc=Adpz2Nls5LEMiBVt9UaGH8B6LFuq5BqQwQcGo6R2tAWOKSopCZ5O91WWzqGC8pgObpg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6UP5SH1VRV2kHV8Vkcjus7NzVLwz_PNNSKTo9vHqcl7A&oe=69FB5979"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JZYcsq89vPkQ7kNvwGdTl2t&_nc_oc=AdrCTSi3c2_gKuTx7tYDJtiZHkTNv2pBxo8JDAleP4GhTG6aohBh2AUTi_xRAZCL4hk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5bIqouXIKsvl-wb92FZ3LRC2no3qiBSh1RGHhNeSEP8Q&oe=69FB30D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y1agXpKyWmAQ7kNvwEawM0R&_nc_oc=Adqy9GpJR6eVJt8gRZuqFM8YUl3stQQzHRVk_4Y7iT2SfToQPQty_GGmO5iPA-Lo2aA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6ofzOI5rkOFdd2B-lq4B9zzlqXn1z92EVH5smmklnQww&oe=69FB3C7B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OP4GgREsJe4Q7kNvwEQWC14&_nc_oc=AdoOME5yEbSS2-cz45-oOOqdjx7bRSxMLGdymTiUWka-sPbcbJ09i4VTTks2DBf5rxA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5rnI1DIlJzFOrsSSz3s7j-PWys6-a8zIhDqqLJxqRLQg&oe=69FB3DCA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ODtOrqPy2mcQ7kNvwEummXX&_nc_oc=AdpSIRUnAJ_gWOiBoTY-AUzaOpsnnYJ0vl9-M64JX8AW5J9Vf5xaCZTG3Z9o_-OK9Ug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7ZRU8-v7iBRMRR8x8DpXQtZSaG9oW5MKVrbPrkTDongg&oe=69FB26FE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se